          "target": {
            "start": 18,
            "end": 23
          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:speak#e-b4121e1a04cc1aaf",
          "text": "The differences in conversational styles became evident when participants listened to audio clips in which two people spoke at the same time but were agreeing with each other and stayed on topic, Hilton said.",
